%% POST /v1/authorizations, observed at b4bef16 (AuthorizePurchase, AuthorizationBooking).
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant M as Merchant
  participant C as AuthorizationController
  participant U as AuthorizePurchase
  participant L as CardLookup
  participant R as Redis
  participant P as PostgreSQL
  participant S as Risk engine
  participant B as AuthorizationBooking (tx, READ COMMITTED)
  M->>C: POST /v1/authorizations + Idempotency-Key
  C->>U: authorize(Purchase)
  U->>P: findByIdempotencyKey
  alt key known
    U-->>C: stored authorization (replay)
  else new request
    U->>L: find(cardId)
    L->>R: GET card:{id}
    alt miss
      L->>P: SELECT card
      L->>R: SET card:{id} TTL
    end
    U->>S: POST /v1/scores (150 ms read timeout)
    S-->>U: score | Unavailable
    U->>B: book(purchase, card, risk)
    B->>P: pg_advisory_xact_lock(hashtext(cardId))
    B->>P: SELECT ledger_entries WHERE card_id
    B->>B: Balance.derive, AuthorizationPolicy.authorize
    B->>P: INSERT authorization (unique idempotency_key)
    B->>P: INSERT ledger_entries HOLD (if approved)
    B->>P: INSERT outbox_events
    B-->>U: Authorization
  end
  U-->>C: Authorization
  C-->>M: 201 + Location
  Note over P: OutboxRelay later: FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED -> publish -> published_at
